We can't beat Ahn Eun Jin at omok?

1335
00:50:54,857 --> 00:50:55,857
Bring it on.

1336
00:50:56,327 --> 00:50:57,897
- I...
- We'll win the brain games.

1337
00:50:58,327 --> 00:50:59,667
