- This is fun.

1347
00:51:14,717 --> 00:51:16,346
You'll be at a disadvantage if Jung Ah is the referee.

1348
00:51:16,347 --> 00:51:18,217
Bring it on, Ahn Eun Jin. Are you seeing this?

1349
00:51:18,887 --> 00:51:20,686
- I get it.
- I won't lose either.

1350
00:51:20,687 --> 00:51:22,516
I'm confident in speed.

1351
00:51:22,517 --> 00:51:24,163
