But I'm not a feeler.

1385
00:52:54,977 --> 00:52:57,186
"It's so nice being back here after a year!"

1386
00:52:57,187 --> 00:52:59,016
I tried to do that in my head first,

1387
00:52:59,017 --> 00:53:00,117
but I just...

1388
