1403
00:53:38,427 --> 00:53:40,727
- It lives in such a nice place.
- Just look at the tree.

1404
00:53:41,627 --> 00:53:43,796
- It's the siblings'.
- My gosh.

1405
00:53:43,797 --> 00:53:44,827
The siblings'.

1406
00:53:45,967 --> 00:53:51,037
(The harbour and refreshing open sea unfold right in front of the house.)

1407
00:53:51,607 --> 00:53:55,637
(A charming, cosy home...)

1408
00:53:56,547 --> 00:54:00,117
