1409
00:54:00,647 --> 00:54:03,017
(Jung Ah enters the house with excitement.)

1410
00:54:03,487 --> 00:54:04,687
It hasn't changed.

1411
00:54:07,617 --> 00:54:10,226
It hasn't changed

1412
00:54:10,227 --> 00:54:11,503
(A place filled with memories for Jung Ah)

1413
00:54:11,527 --> 00:54:12,827
I've seen this place on TV.

1414
00:54:13,527 --> 00:54:14,997
I've seen this house on TV.

1415
00:54:15,257 --> 00:54:17,097
This house is gorgeous.

1416
00:54:19,327 --> 00:54:21,837
- How pretty.
- It sure is pretty in person.

1417
00:54:22,067 --> 00:54:23,236
It's really pretty.

1418
00:54:23,237 --> 00:54:25,183
