1424
00:54:43,357 --> 00:54:44,386
That's our family photo.

1425
00:54:44,387 --> 00:54:45,527
(Laughing)

1426
00:54:45,727 --> 00:54:47,726
It's a themed-family photo.

1427
00:54:47,727 --> 00:54:49,727
