1428
00:54:49,827 --> 00:54:52,496
It's giving off late 1980s and early 1990s vibes.

1429
00:54:52,497 --> 00:54:53,637
(Pure 6090 vibes)

1430
00:54:54,097 --> 00:54:57,507
(Still just as striking)

1431
00:54:57,837 --> 00:55:00,136
