It should be okay, right?

1439
00:55:21,097 --> 00:55:24,727
Dear viewers. We dried off with the AC.

1440
00:55:25,697 --> 00:55:27,597
Our sweat isn't that dirty.

1441
00:55:28,937 --> 00:55:30,707
Gosh, I'm loving it.

1442
00:55:31,307 --> 00:55:32,507
Is it still hot here?

1443
00:55:32,807 --> 00:55:33,877
Yes, it's still hot.

1444
00:55:34,737 --> 00:55:37,477
(On her back)

1445
00:55:38,577 --> 00:55:40,616
(Meanwhile, Yoon Seo got changed.)

1446
00:55:40,617 --> 00:55:42,247
