1450
00:55:51,987 --> 00:55:53,226
You just daze at the leaves.

1451
00:55:53,227 --> 00:55:54,457
- Right, Sun Young?
- Yes.

1452
00:55:55,457 --> 00:55:57,126
This house is really nice.

1453
00:55:57,127 --> 00:55:58,927
(Spaced out)

1454
00:55:59,227 --> 00:56:01,297
I feel like we're in a TV right now.

1455
00:56:03,137 --> 00:56:06,637
