1460
00:56:22,857 --> 00:56:24,627
I'm loving this place.

1461
00:56:25,227 --> 00:56:26,996
- Just look at the tree.
- The tree makes it better.

1462
00:56:26,997 --> 00:56:29,596
I know, right? It's the view from right here.

1463
00:56:29,597 --> 00:56:31,717
(Just lying down and looking at the tree is healing.)

1464
00:56:33,967 --> 00:56:35,866
How do you feel about the show ending...

1465
00:56:35,867 --> 00:56:37,427
