1466
00:56:37,537 --> 00:56:39,037
- Hang of it? Hang of what?
- Yes?

1467
00:56:39,407 --> 00:56:42,876
- We've grown close, - Yes?

1468
00:56:42,877 --> 00:56:45,376
- so I can go all out more.
- I see.

1469
00:56:45,377 --> 00:56:47,216
But it's our last trip. How do you feel about it?

1470
00:56:47,217 --> 00:56:49,647
(Before they know it, it's the last trip.)

1471
00:56:49,947 --> 00:56:51,287
It's such a shame.

1472
00:56:53,587 --> 00:56:56,317
This will all become good memories.

1473
00:56:58,027 --> 00:57:00,526
I lived in a rural area after elementary school,

1474
00:57:00,527 --> 00:57:02,827
