1475
00:57:03,127 --> 00:57:05,826
This place is amazing. It's best to live somewhere nice.

1476
00:57:05,827 --> 00:57:06,967
(Soft, dreamy vibes)

1477
00:57:07,137 --> 00:57:09,337
- Right?
- It's getting too close.

1478
00:57:11,507 --> 00:57:12,806
(Hi.)

1479
00:57:12,807 --> 00:57:14,036
Hi.

1480
00:57:14,037 --> 00:57:15,737
What kind of concept is this?

1481
00:57:16,277 --> 00:57:17,597
Do you want to hang out together?

1482
00:57:18,507 --> 00:57:21,247
(The youngest hamming it up for the camera.)

1483
00:57:22,947 --> 00:57:25,547
(Meanwhile, Sang Hun returns after changing clothes.)

1484
00:57:26,857 --> 00:57:28,757
I'm the only one who hasn't changed yet, right?

1485
00:57:29,787 --> 00:57:31,157
(Laughing)

1486
00:57:32,827 --> 00:57:34,827
