1489
00:57:38,997 --> 00:57:41,136
- Should we take a selfie, Jung Ah?
- Yes, let's take one together.

1490
00:57:41,137 --> 00:57:42,137
Okay.

1491
00:57:42,267 --> 00:57:43,467
I'll take one.

1492
00:57:43,907 --> 00:57:45,567
I'll take some photos of you too.

1493
00:57:46,037 --> 00:57:47,677
Really, I want to...

1494
00:57:48,607 --> 00:57:49,946
In 1, 2, 3.

1495
00:57:49,947 --> 00:57:51,067
(Busy making memories today)

1496
00:57:51,247 --> 00:57:52,606
It's for Instagram.

1497
00:57:52,607 --> 00:57:53,946
My daughter told me no peace sign.

1498
00:57:53,947 --> 00:57:55,547
- What? Why?
- No peace sign? Why?

1499
00:57:56,047 --> 00:57:57,487
- In 1, 2...
- Do this instead.

1500
00:57:59,717 --> 00:58:01,317
(A toothache patient)

1501
00:58:01,587 --> 00:58:04,887
