1502
00:58:06,457 --> 00:58:08,897
I have to learn from Yoon Seo how to look away.

1503
00:58:09,727 --> 00:58:11,766
Looking away?

1504
00:58:11,767 --> 00:58:14,237
She always looks away when taking photos.

1505
00:58:14,937 --> 00:58:18,836
I do. I look into the distance like this.

1506
00:58:18,837 --> 00:58:20,176
