- No.

1510
00:58:27,547 --> 00:58:29,846
I'm not used to taking pictures.

1511
00:58:29,847 --> 00:58:30,847
Me neither.

1512
00:58:30,917 --> 00:58:32,186
I'll take photos of Jung Ah.

1513
00:58:32,187 --> 00:58:33,627
