1514
00:58:34,057 --> 00:58:35,057
- Jung Ah.
- Yes?

1515
00:58:35,057 --> 00:58:36,057
You look so pretty right now.

1516
00:58:36,058 --> 00:58:37,157
- Right now?
- Yes.

1517
00:58:37,557 --> 00:58:39,127
With the flower behind.

1518
00:58:39,587 --> 00:58:42,857
A little to this side.

1519
00:58:43,367 --> 00:58:44,896
- This side.
- Do I look away?

1520
00:58:44,897 --> 00:58:46,737
A little more to this side.

1521
00:58:47,697 --> 00:58:49,906
(But Jung Ah doesn't know where to look.)

1522
00:58:49,907 --> 00:58:51,236
I become awkward again.

1523
00:58:51,237 --> 00:58:53,537
- Drink the coffee.
- I need to look away. Drink it?

1524
00:58:54,337 --> 00:58:55,476
(Much more natural after adding an item)

1525
00:58:55,477 --> 00:58:56,947
Gorgeous. I'm serious.

1526
00:58:58,407 --> 00:59:00,076
(Learning the latest trends, Coffee is just for show.)

1527
00:59:00,077 --> 00:59:03,047
